{"msg":"操作成功","threadsObj":{"searchValue":null,"createBy":null,"createTime":null,"updateBy":null,"updateTime":null,"remark":null,"params":{},"tid":"1443559716969164800","queryCode":4117257,"lybh":"[2026]55440461","lybhvalue":null,"queryCodes":null,"queryCodeList":[],"fid":"705571437862064128","typeId":"635836920174825472","domainId":"450","topicId":null,"kindIds":null,"kindIds_txt":null,"nickName":"手机用户-179552829571****","userId":"1442512992096845824","subject":"黄陂区F水星城信德中城物业乱收水费","content":"标题... F水星城小区物业多项问题集中举报，请求纳入物业评议考核\n \n本人实名反映本小区物业长期不作为，多项问题反复投诉拒不整改，附带实拍证据：\n \n1. 安保值守严重缺位：门岗岗亭经常无人值守，且拍到保安值班在岗亭内吸烟，岗位纪律松散，安保形同虚设，安防无保障；\n\n2. 消防隐患突出：灭火器压力表异常，消防器材巡检走过场，存在重大安全风险；\n\n3. 公共收益不透明：广告、摊位等公共收益公示信息含糊，缺少明细，业主无法监督收益去向；\n\n4. 占道摆摊无序：小区内乱摆摊占道，物业放任不管，不做规范管理；\n\n5. 垃圾分类房脏乱：垃圾房垃圾外溢、散落杂物，清运保洁不到位，滋生蚊虫异味扰民；\n \n物业长期漠视业主诉求，整改敷衍，不落实管理责任，严重侵害业主权益。恳请主管部门介入核查，责令物业限期逐项整改并公示整改结果；将全部问题纳入本年度物业评议考核，作为物业满意度评价依据。本人留存全部照片证据，随时配合回访核查。","anonymousCode":null,"dateline":1795777856,"feedbackList":null,"ip":null,"viewsNum":"0","commentsNum":0,"favNum":0,"threadState":1,"checkNum":0,"attachment":1,"answerAttachment":null,"processState":0,"handleState":0,"traceState":0,"markState":0,"reportState":0,"source":"15","mobile":null,"leaderAnswer":0,"satisfaction":0,"lastupdate":1795780851,"lastAnswerTime":null,"lastFeedbackTime":null,"availableTime":0,"checkReason":null,"info":null,"extraInfoStr":null,"deleteInfo":null,"fdFailCount":0,"recommend":0,"ansCheckState":0,"lastcheck":null,"timelyAnswered":0,"caseNum":null,"jd":null,"wd":null,"postCode":null,"streetCode":null,"courtCode":null,"overt":1,"gids":null,"score":0,"togetherNum":1,"fidsNum":1,"urgeNum":null,"fids":null,"asids":null,"answerNum":null,"endTime":null,"viewcount":163,"readState":null,"acceptNum":null,"departUnid":null,"departUnid_txt":"无","committeeUnid":null,"committeeName":null,"submittedMessageboard":null,"enterpriseName":null,"anonymousState":0,"togetherData":"[{\"forumUnid\":\"705571437862064128\",\"handlestate\":0,\"handletime\":17957